DESIGN SPECIFICATION (FIGMA):

NSS element	Role used in the flowchart
MSC	Call set-up, switching and paging
VLR	Temporary subscriber record in the visited area
HLR	Permanent subscriber record and current VLR address
AuC	Generates authentication triplets
EIR	Checks the IMEI (valid, stolen or faulty)
GMSC	Entry point for calls to a mobile; interrogates the HLR
